      "side": 1,
      "message": "Keep in mind this puts DECRYPTED [plain text] credentials in the cache (potentially external, e.g. memcache with less guarding that keystone\u0027s config/internal runtime)\n\nThe decrypting *may* meed to be in the uncached version. This is likely a security issue that should not be introduced. We make effort to cache un-hashed passwords. These elements are equivalent to unhashed password and results in exposed plaintext secure data.",
