      "writtenOn": "2019-05-13T21:57:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You need to invalidate the bare list as well. This is because the way you have this implemented the raw list_credentials may be type_none, so you cache all of the creds for the user and the type cache is only invalidated.\n\nYou need to add this line as well:\n\n    self._list_credentials_for_user.invalidate(self, cred[\u0027user_id\u0027], None)",
